2},{"text":"i alla dina livsdagar,","poem":3}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"och må du få se barn till dina barn.","poem":1},{"text":"Frid över Israel!","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/swe_fol/PSA/128.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/swe_fol/PSA/129.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/swe_fol/PSA/127.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}